	"nodes":[
		{"id":"e287c0f146f80ab6","type":"text","text":"###### 数据类型\n- string\n- hash\n- list\n- set\n- zset","x":-195,"y":-364,"width":101,"height":180},
		{"id":"61dbad4b1f4cca49","type":"text","text":"###### ZSet","x":-168,"y":-71,"width":61,"height":50},
		{"id":"18137ed1670bf95b","type":"text","text":">参数顺序: `set_name score(start end) ob_name WITHSCORE`\n- `ZADD` 向集合添加元素\n- `ZINCRBY` 增加分数\n- `ZSCORE` 查看分数\n- `ZREVRANGE start end`  倒序获取指定排名元素\n- `ZRANGEBYSCORE` 升序获取分数区间对象","x":-7,"y":-66,"width":456,"height":197},
		{"id":"0ec61ae27ce6320b","type":"text","text":"ziplist/skiplist","x":-301,"y":117,"width":162,"height":50},
		{"id":"17272d2d5c6e126a","type":"text","text":"skiplist VS B+ tree\n- ==内存 VS 磁盘== ---I/O\n- 实现复杂度/维护\n- 写入: 局部性 VS 页分裂","x":-302,"y":269,"width":218,"height":122},
		{"id":"aaef3fb7d48b0d77","type":"text","text":"##### Hash","x":-6,"y":-300,"width":63,"height":50},
		{"id":"8a39f4a91e7abd69","x":-278,"y":-495,"width":81,"height":50,"type":"text","text":"##### string"},
		{"id":"dc3ef600b17981cc","x":-366,"y":-749,"width":100,"height":154,"type":"text","text":"##### SDS\n- len\n- alloc\n- flags\n- `buf[]`"},
		{"id":"3d68569c217d1454","x":-128,"y":-802,"width":189,"height":96,"type":"text","text":"- O(1)获取长度\n- 二进制安全 \"\\0\"\n- 无缓冲区溢出"},
		{"id":"a621e7dee0a604b6","type":"text","text":"初始: 2 hash; hash2 未分配内存\n**refresh**\n1. 给hash2分配空间  \\*2\n2. 迁移数据 hash1 -> hash2\n   迁移同时==**处理新请求**==\n\t- del/sel/upd -> hash1,hash2\n\t- ins -> hash2\n3. 释放hash1 空间\n4. hash2 => hash1","x":70,"y":-625,"width":328,"height":249},
		{"id":"67787204264d61c8","x":-456,"y":-94,"width":159,"height":116,"type":"text","text":"- 排行榜\n- 延迟任务队列\n- 范围查询\n- 权重消息队列"},
		{"id":"a91f61298eee4c31","x":-605,"y":-305,"width":112,"height":62,"type":"text","text":"# redis"},
